{"unit_id":"tag:0421:proof","translation":"分离（separated）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是分离的（separated），见空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0001>。因此得到定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。设<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。假设每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>分离（separated）。这意味着每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>都是闭浸入（closed immersion）。fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）的基变换（base change）是fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），见空间上的拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0003>，因此<MATH_0007>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。此外，每个<MATH_0008>都是态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）。因此，由引理<REF_0004>可知<MATH_0010>为闭浸入（closed immersion），即<MATH_0011>分离（separated）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"空间上的拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context