{"unit_id":"tag:0423:proof","translation":"我们使用引理<REF_0001>证明此结论。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>得到。设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>拟仿射（quasi-affine）。设<MATH_0005>为表示<MATH_0006>的概形（scheme）。得到典范同构（canonical isomorphism）<MATH_0007>，因为两个概形（schemes）都表示代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0008>。这是<MATH_0009>的下降（descent）数据，见下降（Descent），定义<REF_0003>（验证略去，可比较下降（Descent），引理<REF_0004>）。由于<MATH_0010>拟仿射（quasi-affine），此下降（descent）数据有效（effective），见下降（Descent），引理<REF_0005>。因此存在概形（scheme）<MATH_0011>，其基底为<MATH_0012>，以及同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0013>，与下降（descent）数据相容。当然，<MATH_0014>拟仿射（quasi-affine）（由构造或由下降（Descent），引理<REF_0006>）。注意，<MATH_0015>为fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），将<MATH_0016>解释为<MATH_0017>的元素（element），可知<MATH_0018>。由<MATH_0019>的层条件（sheaf condition）（见空间的性质，命题<REF_0007>），得到态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>。由构造，它到<MATH_0021>的基变换（base change）是同构（isomorphism），从而它本身是同构（isomorphism），由引理<REF_0008>。这证明<MATH_0022>可表示（representable）为拟仿射（quasi-affine）概形（scheme），于是得证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表示"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射","context":"引用章节术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"测试对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"箭头性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"箭头性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"箭头；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-affine","target_term":"拟仿射","context":"下降性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"表示对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical isomorphism","target_term":"典范同构","context":"表示间的箭头；待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"表示对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被表示对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据；待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章节；待决。"},{"source_term":"effective","target_term":"有效","context":"下降数据有效性；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"所给箭头；待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term